WEBVTT

00:03.920 --> 00:04.720
All right, friends.

00:04.720 --> 00:10.160
So that's all those are the best practices, tips and tricks that I've connected in the many years working

00:10.160 --> 00:11.120
with SQL.

00:11.160 --> 00:17.040
And now my final thoughts about this is that try always to focus on making clear queries.

00:17.080 --> 00:22.880
Make it like easy to read and easy to understand and try to optimize the performance only if it's needed.

00:22.880 --> 00:28.280
So if you have like small database, don't worry a lot about the performance, because the SQL optimizer

00:28.320 --> 00:32.760
can pick the best plan for you and focus only on having simple queries.

00:32.760 --> 00:37.280
And if there is like performance problem, always test using the execution plan.

00:37.280 --> 00:38.560
It should be your judge.

00:38.560 --> 00:44.240
So if you are applying an index or you are rewriting your queries, always compare before and after

00:44.240 --> 00:45.680
using the execution plan.

00:45.680 --> 00:50.320
And if you are gaining more performance, then adapt the new query or the new index.

00:50.360 --> 00:51.080
All right my friends.

00:51.080 --> 00:55.840
